            "authorAssociation": "MEMBER",
            "body": "This should now be resolved on latest `main`. I indeed opted for [adjusting for this special case](https://github.com/echasnovski/mini.nvim/blob/0429e9ee9d35faef51971abdbb1b26d2540b5a5f/doc/mini-align.txt#L813-L814) as preserving indentation is already a case with `trim()` step. Thanks again for noticing this!",
            "bodyHTML": "<p dir=\"auto\">This should now be resolved on latest <code class=\"notranslate\">main</code>. I indeed opted for <a href=\"https://github.com/echasnovski/mini.nvim/blob/0429e9ee9d35faef51971abdbb1b26d2540b5a5f/doc/mini-align.txt#L813-L814\">adjusting for this special case</a> as preserving indentation is already a case with <code class=\"notranslate\">trim()</code> step. Thanks again for noticing this!</p>",
